    "body": "Your capstone\nOne project. Five snapshots.\nKeep the same project record as your evidence and solution improve.\nChoose a bounded need with a partner, your organization, or the supplied classroom client. Deliver an actual document kit, decision aid, AI-assisted service, or no-code experience. Someone else must complete its intended task; record any assistance they need.\nUse one folder with five sections: need, solution, test, business case, and handoff. Keep source evidence and versions alongside it. The final synthesis can be a 4–6-page decision brief and 6–8-slide pitch with links to the artifact, calculations, observations, and instructions.\nDownload the project template\nFive milestones for a new full offeringMilestone | After unit | Suggested weight |\n1. Problem and feasible scope | 3 | 15% |\n2. First usable solution | 5 | 20% |\n3. Pilot and learning | 7 | 25% |\n4. Viability and route to users | 10 | 15% |\n5. Demonstration and handoff | 12 | 25% |"
